{"id":"c5d6c3cf4a244512","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-closed-comprehension-compat.md","title":"历史入口","display":"df-closed-comprehension — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-closed-comprehension-compat","aliases":["16-df-closed-comprehension-compat"],"display":"df-closed-comprehension — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]"],"source":"Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-closed-comprehension-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-closed-comprehension-compat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-comprehension — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,\\chi)\">\\((p,\\chi)\\)</span> 为候选理解结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedComp}\\)</span> 为此处保留的拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{ClosedComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{ClosedComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>旧文件入口保留；两个拼写均携带理解函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>，完整条件为满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和与基终对象。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$ 为候选理解结构；$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$ 见 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]，$\\mathrm{ClosedComp}$ 为此处保留的拼写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{ClosedComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":974,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension-compat|df-closed-comprehension — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["3015a5a145e2e498"]}